{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077520/extras/780495a35f689e126f8c14bd12b2a626.poster.avif?t=1759484017\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077520/extras/780495a35f689e126f8c14bd12b2a626.webm?t=1759484017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077520/extras/780495a35f689e126f8c14bd12b2a626.mp4?t=1759484017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifting Chambers</strong> is a first-person horror exploration puzzle game set inside a massive, decaying manor where adaptation is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a massive manor where the room layout shifts when the bell rings. You must explore a constantly changing layout, solve cryptic puzzles, and avoid the enigmatic guardians who brought you here\u2014and won\u2019t let you leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape the shifting chambers\u2014or become part of them?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077520/extras/89f3111a5a3b587031721293e651d1ce.poster.avif?t=1759484017\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077520/extras/89f3111a5a3b587031721293e651d1ce.webm?t=1759484017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077520/extras/89f3111a5a3b587031721293e651d1ce.mp4?t=1759484017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Manor Floor - </strong>Experience a shortened version of one the three floors in the manor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shifting Rooms</strong> - The manor\u2019s doors link to different rooms when the bell rings. You must adapt to ever changing layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Driven Exploration</strong> \u2013 Solve environmental puzzles to unlock an escape route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manor Guardian</strong> - Avoid getting detected by one of the manor guardians stalking the hallways. Intelligent and adapting AI keeps the tension high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere</strong> - Minimal UI, no hand-holding\u2014just dread, strategy, and the constant fear of what\u2019s behind the next door.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR Support</strong> - Fully immerse yourself in the horror with native VR support.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077520?t=1759484017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077520?t=1759484017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077520/cec5e4bc28c40aac6c7f3462941b98b76fa2f83f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759484017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077520/cec5e4bc28c40aac6c7f3462941b98b76fa2f83f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759484017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detail